  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I0GIu0B.png\" width=\"1920\" height=\"810\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/EPZ4K8QgN9\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/948491825046499349?color=yellow&label=Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"305\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCE3FisP1MrVri5WlQ8euuLA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCE3FisP1MrVri5WlQ8euuLA?color=yellow&label=YouTube&logo=youtube&logoColor=blue&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"215\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">📃 | Описание | 📃</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Усовершенствуйте рыбалку в десятки раз благодаря появлению 5 способов ловли рыбы.</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Среди них: обычная рыбалка с улучшенной механикой, простые одноразовые ловушки, многоразовые ловушки, ручная ловля и автоматическая рыбалка. Также будет добавлено несколько новых видов морских и наземных существ. Появится возможность создавать собственные удочки и прокачивать их.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-fishing-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FRRThpf.png\" width=\"205\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">✨Особенности✨</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Ручная рыбалка</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Рыболовные ловушки</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Новые способы рыбалки</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">➡Следующее обновление✅</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Добавить специальный верстак</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Добавить систему крафта и таблиц лута</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">Обновление для версий 1.20.4, 1.20.6</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">💰Поддержать нас 📨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/swutm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=swutm&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"310\" height=\"44\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.buymeacoffee.com%252fswutm\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-Buy_Me_a_Coffee-FFDD00?style=for-the-badge&logo=buymeacoffee&logoColor=535353\" width=\"255\" height=\"44\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdonatello.to%252fSWUTM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ASc3Yua.png\"></a><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">🖼Скриншоты🖼&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">СКОРО✨</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">📷GIF🖼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">СКОРО✨</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\">🎥Видео🎥</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">СКОРО✨</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">❗❓Часто задаваемые вопросы❗❓</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">1) В: Будет ли порт на версию «x»?</span><br><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\">О: Возможно</span><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">💻Наши модификации💻</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-caves-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hPAssBQ.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/edible-rotten-flash\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iV2cxLX.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ukraine-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ee7uXJp.png\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cooked-apple\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jifMjTY.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1ZNFiyF.png\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MPlP8QT.png\" width=\"1920\"></p>",
